# More follow-up/alias/meaning sequences
let square of x be x times x
what is square of 4?
what is its range?
x if x is positive, otherwise minus x; call it myabs
what is the derivative of myabs?
what is myabs of -3?
what is the range of myabs for x from -4 to 4?
the sum of i from 1 to 10 of i squared
the product over k from 1 to 5 of k
